      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "没错，勇敢之心选择挑战。\n因为她永远活在比赛世界的最前线……\n艰难地求生。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c37f089f1411a301f17b84dac4147ca85a70b8421ad14ab3114df8130cd33cc",
